@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam maxmessagesize 160
skinparam ParticipantPadding 55
skinparam BoxPadding 12

title 完整帧生命周期 — 时间驱动链 + 输入驱动链

participant "Timeline\n(驱动源)" as TL
participant "ClassicLineComponent\nILineComponent" as Comp
participant "ClassicLinePool\nILinePool" as Pool
participant "ClassicLineNode\nILineNode" as Node
participant "ClassicLineTail\nILineTail" as Tail
participant "ClassicDirection\nIDirection" as Dir
participant "ClassicLineController\nILineController" as Ctrl

== 时间驱动链 (每帧) ==

TL -> Comp: 驱动
Comp -> Pool: UpdatePool(time)
activate Pool

Pool -> Pool: ProcessPendingNodes(time)
note right: pendingNodes → lineNodes (排序插入)

Pool -> Pool: 回收超前节点 (BeginTime > time)
note right: lineNodes → pendingNodes

loop 遍历 lineNodes
    Pool -> Node: UpdatePosition(time)
    activate Node
    Node -> Tail: UpdateTail(beginPos, deltaTime, direction)
    Tail -> Dir: UpdatePosition(startPoint, time, tailTransform)
    Dir --> Tail: MotionState (匀速直线运动)
    Tail --> Node: MotionState

    Node -> Node: switch (NodeMotionType)\n  Grounded → IsGrounded\n  Falling → GetLandingPoint\n  FallingToGrounded → IsGrounded

    Node --> Pool: currentMotionState
    deactivate Node
end

Pool --> Comp: UpdatePosition(motionState)
deactivate Pool

Comp -> Comp: lineHeadTransform.position\n  = motionState.WorldSpacePosition\nlineHeadTransform.rotation\n  = motionState.WorldSpaceRotation

== 输入驱动链 (仅 Playing 状态) ==

Ctrl -> Ctrl: Update() 检测鼠标/键盘
alt Input.GetMouseButtonDown(0) || GetKeyDown(Space)
    Ctrl -> Ctrl: 过滤 UI 点击 (EventSystem)
    Ctrl -> Pool: AddNode(NodeInputType.Turn, time)
    note left of Pool: Instantiate → pendingNodes.Add\n等待下一帧 ProcessPendingNodes 处理
end

note over Comp, Ctrl
  **两条驱动链汇合于 Pool:**
  时间链 (左→右): Timeline → Component → Pool → Node → Tail → Direction
  输入链 (右→左): Controller → Pool.AddNode → pendingNodes → ProcessPendingNodes

  **坐标约定:** Pool 参考系内, y 轴反方向为 "下"
  **物理:** 节点通过 RefreshNodeByFormer 继承前节点的位置和物理状态
end note

@enduml
